              "China reported lower than expected manufacturing activity for December amid a trade dispute with the U.S.\n\nSkip Navigation\n\nMarkets\n\nBusiness\n\nInvesting\n\nTech\n\nPolitics & Policy\n\nVideo\n\nWatchlist\n\nInvesting Club\n\nJoin IC\n\nPRO\n\nJoin Pro\n\nLivestream\n\nChina Economy",
